["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ガラス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">玻璃；玻璃窗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197661\">ビールびんはガラスでできている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">啤酒瓶是玻璃做的。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/349684\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">き</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">精神；心灵；内心；性质；性格；气质；意图；想法；意愿；动机；心情；感受；意识；知觉；关心；注意；体贴；担心；兴趣；关注；空气；大气；气氛；氛围；情调；香气；芳香；风味；味道；气（中国传统哲学与医学中的概念）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103674\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>親切<rp>(</rp><rt>しんせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>というよりむしろ<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がやさしい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他比善良更有情心。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">機会</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>日本人<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す<ruby>機会<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">和日本人说话的机会很少。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">危険</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">危险；危难；危害；风险；危险</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183571\"><ruby>危険<rp>(</rp><rt>きけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くびるとすぐやってくる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看到危险,就很快就会到来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">聞こえる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きこえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">听得见；听得到；传入耳朵；听起来；显得；给人的印象；有名；出名；闻名；听得进去；接受（说法）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226968\">お<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはあの<ruby>音<rp>(</rp><rt>おと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こえないのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难道你听不到那个声音吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">汽車</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きしゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">蒸汽机车；蒸汽火车；（长途）列车；火车；非电气化列车；柴油列车</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183132\"><ruby>汽車<rp>(</rp><rt>きしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火车还没有到达。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">季節</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きせつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">季节；时令</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148185\"><ruby>秋<rp>(</rp><rt>あき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>読書<rp>(</rp><rt>どくしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもってこいの<ruby>季節<rp>(</rp><rt>きせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">秋天是阅读的好季节。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">規則</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">规则；规定</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222439\">この<ruby>規則<rp>(</rp><rt>きそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあなたにも<ruby>当<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てはまる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些规则也适用于你。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">切手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きって</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">邮票</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">切</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\