<rt>ふちゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你不注意忘记家务。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:決める\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">決める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">决定</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>留学<rp>(</rp><rt>りゅうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することに<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">决定去留学了。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気持ち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きもち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感受；感觉；心情；精神状态；准备；就绪；态度；想法；感情；体谅；感谢；略微；有点；稍微</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183198\"><ruby>気持<rp>(</rp><rt>きも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちのいい<ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではありませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难道这不是一个美好的早晨吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">着物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">和服；日本传统服装（尤指全身式）；衣服；服装</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92348\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>着物<rp>(</rp><rt>きもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ると<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>へん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她穿着这件衣服,看起来很奇怪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">客</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">客人；访客；顾客；客户；观众；游客；乘客；（招待客人用的）容器的量词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74683\"><ruby>春先<rp>(</rp><rt>はるさき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だから<ruby>客<rp>(</rp><rt>きゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もあまりいませんでした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">春天,客人不多。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">急</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">突然的；意外的；紧急的；急迫的；陡峭的；险峻的；迅速的；快速的；紧急情况；危机；危险；紧急；匆促；仓促；（雅乐或能乐中）曲终</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220822\">この<ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れは<ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个河流的流动很快。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">急行</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">快车</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">急</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">教育</span><span 