<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>与<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてくれる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">现代技术给了我们很多东西。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">空気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くうき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">空气；大气；气氛；氛围；存在感极弱的人；毫不起眼的人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"169418\"><ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>空気<rp>(</rp><rt>くうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がとてもきれいだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">山上空气很干净。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">空港</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くうこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机场</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200324\">どの<ruby>空港<rp>(</rp><rt>くうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>出発<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっぱつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">从哪个机场出发?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">草</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">草；杂草；药草；茅草；忍者；大麻；非正品的；劣质的；哈哈；大笑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175661\"><ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>草<rp>(</rp><rt>くさ<