-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">比べる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くらべる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">比较</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>去年<rp>(</rp><rt>きょねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>比<rp>(</rp><rt>くら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べて、<ruby>物価<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">和去年相比，物价上涨了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くれる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">给（我或我方）；让（我方）得到；给（带轻蔑，常作「くれてやる」）；为我（方）做……；费心做；对（某人）不利地做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79331\"><ruby>友達<rp>(</rp><rt>ともだち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がはがきをくれるように<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>頼<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的朋友请求我给他一口气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暮れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">天黑；日暮；终了；结束；陷入；沉浸于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127075\"><ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らぬ<ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>あいだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はとっぷりと<ruby>暮<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不知不觉的日子里,我一直过得很久。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">具合</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぐあい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">状况；状态；健康；健康状况；方式；方法；样子；情况；运气；际遇；面子；体面；得体；礼仪</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150500\"><ruby>時計<rp>(</rp><rt>とけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>具合<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">时钟不舒服。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">毛</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">け</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">毛发；头发；毛皮；绒毛；羊毛；绒毛；羽毛；羽绒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175314\"><ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>毛<rp>(</rp><rt>け</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいわばセーターだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">狗的头发是安全的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">計画</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいかく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">计划</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">画</a></span></div></li>"]